{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this expansion of <i>Forest 6174</i>, you'll once again play as Danny,\u00a0but this time, you'll explore a darker and more unsettling side of him. Along the way, you'll finally uncover who <strong>Judy</strong> really is and what her true purpose has been from the beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set before the events of the main game, this short but intense chapter adds new layers of tension and meaning to the story of <i>Forest 6174</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A brief experience where every second counts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New, carefully crafted environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A deeper and more immersive atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pure psychological horror.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Approximately 5\u20137 minutes of narrative gameplay.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3772630?t=1752440670","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3772630?t=1752440670","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772630/7b2f6b237cbd77d0b874aedc18b06f7305abd1b4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752440670","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772630/7b2f6b237cbd77d0b874aedc18b06f7305abd1b4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752440670","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this expansion of <i>Forest 6174</i>, you'll once again play as Danny,\u00a0but this time, you'll explore a darker and more unsettling side of him. Along the way, you'll finally uncover who <strong>Judy</strong> really is and what her true purpose has been from t